    <activityDescription>
      <activity id="b9d289b7-422d-5ce0-aeab-38a60b5720d0" activityNameId="ef8bd8c2-293c-5881-95c1-61e0a3f023cd" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">xx Electricity, natural gas, allocation exergy, at SOFC-GT fuel cell 180kWe, future</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: xx Electricity, natural gas, allocation exergy, at SOFC-GT fuel cell 180kWe, future
The multioutput-process 'natural gas, burned in SOFC-GT fuel cell 180kWe delivers the coproducts 'heat, natural gas, allocation exergy, at SOFC-GT fuel cell 180kWe' and 'electricity, natural gas, allocation exergy, at SOFC-GT fuel cell 180kWe'. The exergy allocation is the allocation scheme suggested to be used within the ecoinvent database (e.g. in electricity mixes).;
UUID: 2e4ec349-de8b-344d-8bc6-8923dafc0716
The module includes fuel input, infrastructure, emissions to air, and working materials for operation.
Location: Natural gas input modelled for Switzerland. Process applicable in central European conditions.
Technology: Hybrid system combining a 125 kWe solid oxide fuel cell (SOFC) with tubular stack design and a 55kWe micro gas turbine. For central cogeneration use. Performance, stack lifetime and catalyst use according to expected future values for a serial product. Operation with connection to low pressure gas network. Electrical efficiency 58%, total efficiency 80%. Operation as base load engine with low partial load hours.
Time period: undefined
Production volume: na
Sampling: Literature data and manufacturer information 
Extrapolations: none
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_2e4ec349-de8b-344d-8bc6-8923dafc0716.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
      <geography geographyId="fdab769f-4bdb-5024-8349-c1745bbb2597" geographyContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83">
